# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source corpus — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This is the load-bearing section. NOTICE.md and README.md both state that the
# source material is not included in this repository. Roosevelt's own writing is
# public domain and is freely available from Project Gutenberg by the catalogue
# numbers listed in NOTICE.md — there is no reason to vendor ~2.5M tokens of it
# here. The one secondhand work consulted for context, Harbaugh's *Power and
# Responsibility*, is still in copyright, and one careless `git add -A` from the
# directory holding the books would publish it.
#
# The corpus stays on the machine that ran the distillation.
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3
*.djvu
*.doc
*.docx
*.rtf
*.odt
*.txt

corpus/
corpora/
sources/
source/
raw/
transcripts/
incoming/
uploaded_attachments/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distillation run artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If a fold-in is ever run from inside this repo, persona-distiller writes its
# work directory and intermediate JSON here. Those are scratch, not deliverables
# — the honesty ledger in fidelity-ledger/provenance.md is what gets committed.
#
# fidelity.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the machine-readable twin of
# the ledger and is shipped with the package.
persona_work/
.persona_work/
work/
style_samples/

coverage_map.json
passages.json
extractions.json
scores.json
core_elements.json
manifest.json
segspec.json
registers.json
style.json
holdout.json
split.json
gate_results.json
proj_*.json
disc_*.json
name_audit*.json
validate*.json

